{"unit_id":"skyzou071026-collab__dsh-coopanion#card-zh","repo":"skyzou071026-collab/dsh-coopanion","commit":"eb7997b21059e464be284bef266ba4006f0f44a4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Coopanion（DSH 桌面端插件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供桌面鲸鱼伙伴，并在桌面端展示任务状态与提醒。插件入口接入 DSH agent 事件，客户端注册设置面板并通过本地界面连接桌宠。可以启动、隐藏和重启桌宠，调整外观与陪伴选项，跟踪会话进度，并配置系统通知和未处理事项提醒。适合希望在桌面上获得可视化陪伴、快速查看任务状态或及时回到待处理会话的 DSH 用户。代码未声明外部 API 密钥或账户要求。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:23-24","cordis.patch.yml:1-8","dist/index.js:1-90"]}
{"unit_id":"skyzou071026-collab__dsh-coopanion#card-en","repo":"skyzou071026-collab/dsh-coopanion","commit":"eb7997b21059e464be284bef266ba4006f0f44a4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Coopanion adds a whale desktop pet and task notifications to DeepSeek Harness. Its settings panel controls the pet, appearance, companionship, and session reminders. It suits users who want a desktop companion and prompts to return to DSH. No external API key or account is declared.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:23-24","cordis.patch.yml:1-8","dist/index.js:1-90"]}
