{"unit_id":"skyzou071026-collab__dsh-coopanion#feature-1","repo":"skyzou071026-collab/dsh-coopanion","commit":"eb7997b21059e464be284bef266ba4006f0f44a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Coopanion 的功能「桌面鲸鱼伙伴」：在桌面窗口显示可配置的鲸鱼伙伴。用户可从设置面板启动、显示、隐藏或重启桌宠，并调整尺寸、漫游和陪伴模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:15-17","src/client/Settings.tsx:94-129"]}
{"unit_id":"skyzou071026-collab__dsh-coopanion#feature-2","repo":"skyzou071026-collab/dsh-coopanion","commit":"eb7997b21059e464be284bef266ba4006f0f44a4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Coopanion 的功能「任务与待处理提醒」：依据 DSH 会话事件整理任务完成、审批或问题等待处理状态，并可在客户端配置系统通知和提醒时间；通知操作可跳回对应会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/notification-broker.ts:96-110","src/client/index.ts:66-88","src/client/Settings.tsx:133-145"]}
